      "mode": "hybrid",
      "answer": "**Main idea**\n\nThe paper introduces the **Transformer**, a novel neural network architecture for sequence transduction that **relies exclusively on attention mechanisms** and completely **dispenses with recurrence and convolutional layers**. By using self\u2011attention (including multi\u2011head attention) to capture global dependencies between input and output positions, the model achieves much greater parallelism, faster training, and state\u2011of\u2011the\u2011art translation performance.",
